<section class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="tagline">About PraxisIQ</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Where deep expertise meets decisive action.</h1>
    <p class="page-subtitle">PraxisIQ is a person-led consultancy. You work directly with someone who's shipped AI products, restructured data teams, and helped institutions rethink how they teach and operate.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="mission">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 720px;">
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Why PraxisIQ exists</h2>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem; color: var(--n700); line-height: 1.7;">The gap between knowing AI matters and actually making it work is where most organizations stall. Strategy decks pile up. Pilot projects fizzle. Faculty push back. Executives lose patience.</p>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem; color: var(--n700); line-height: 1.7;">PraxisIQ exists to close that gap. The name says it: <strong>Praxis</strong> — the practical application of theory — plus <strong>IQ</strong> — intelligence, sharpness. We don't just advise. We build alongside you until the work is done and the results are real.</p>
    <p style="color: var(--n700); line-height: 1.7;">This is a person-led consultancy, not a faceless agency. No handoffs to junior associates. No recycled playbooks. Every engagement gets direct access to deep expertise across AI, product, and higher education — because that's the only way this work actually lands.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--subtle" id="approach">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">How we work</h2>
    <div class="card-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));">
      <div class="card reveal">
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem;">Outcome-led</h3>
        <p>We start with what changes for you — reduced risk, faster time-to-market, measurable adoption — and work backward to scope.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal">
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem;">Audience-aware</h3>
        <p>Whether you're a provost, a product lead, or a C-suite executive, we meet you where you are and speak your language.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal">
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem;">Implementation-focused</h3>
        <p>Strategy without execution is shelf-ware. Every engagement includes a path to implementation, not just a set of recommendations.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal">
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem;">Human-first</h3>
        <p>AI transformation is people transformation. We build buy-in, upskill teams, and design for adoption — not just deployment.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="contact">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="contact-grid">
      <div>
        <h2 class="section-heading" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">Let's talk.</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--n700); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.6;">Book a free 30-minute discovery call. No pitch decks, no pressure. Just an honest conversation about where you are and what's possible.</p>
        <p style="color: var(--n500); font-size: 0.875rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">You can also reach me directly:</p>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 1rem;"><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></p>
        <p><a href="{{ site.linkedin.personal }}" style="font-size: 0.9375rem;">Connect on LinkedIn &rarr;</a></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <form action="https://formspree.io/f/{{ site.formspreeId }}" method="POST">
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="name">Name</label>
              <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required placeholder="Your name">
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="email">Email</label>
              <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required placeholder="you@org.com">
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="org">Organization</label>
            <input type="text" id="org" name="organization" placeholder="University, company, or team">
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="message">How can PraxisIQ help?</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" required placeholder="Tell me about what you're working on..."></textarea>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="referral">How did you hear about PraxisIQ?</label>
            <select id="referral" name="referral">
              <option value="" disabled selected>Select one (optional)</option>
              <option value="search">Search engine</option>
              <option value="linkedin">LinkedIn</option>
              <option value="referral">Referral</option>
              <option value="conference">Conference or event</option>
              <option value="article">Article or blog post</option>
              <option value="other">Other</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn-primary form-submit">Send message &rarr;</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
